  "design": "Fixed64natural validation documents crossed with4prefix lengths,256contexts. All frozen H764 ridge settings, fixed and adaptive coordinate selection; H754fixed/adaptivewritePCA and3randomTopK controls, H755scalar8 all3seeds, native control. Replace final L5H5 head activation by reconstruction, downstream live. Measure actual KL(native||reconstructed) and observed next-token CE change separately, with write reconstruction error. No selection or fitting on these metrics.",
